| ProductName        | Value | Weight |
|--------------------|-------|--------|
| Espresso Beans     | 100   | 1.0    |
| Colombian Roast    | 150   | 1.5    |
| Arabica Blend      | 80    | 1.2    |
| French Roast       | 120   | 1.3    |
| Italian Roast      | 130   | 1.4    |
